OL,3,AMan dies after being stabbed by group
OL,4,Ain balaclavas
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a 27-year-old man was
OL,8,Fstabbed in Manchester.
OL,10,FOfficers were called to Moss Bank in
OL,11,Fthe Crumpsall area of the city shortly
OL,12,Fafter 01:30 GMT following reports that
OL,13,Fa man had suffered several stab wounds.
OL,14,FHe later died from his injuries in an
OL,15,Fambulance.
OL,17,FGreater Manchester Police (GMP) said
OL,18,Finitial inquiries suggested the victim
OL,19,Fhad been attacked by "a number of
OL,20,Fmales" all believed to have been
OL,21,Fwearing dark clothing and balaclavas.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
