OL,3,AUS has floated Ukraine ceding Donbas
OL,4,Afor Nato membership, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FKyiv has long sought membership of the
OL,7,Fmilitary alliance to deter future
OL,8,Fthreats, but this previously been
OL,9,Fopposed by the US and others while
OL,10,FRussia has said another Nato member on
OL,11,Fits border was unacceptable.
OL,13,FZelensky has also consistently said
OL,14,FUkraine was unwilling to give up
OL,15,Fsovereign territory, despite Moscow's
OL,16,Fdemands for it to cede the Donbas.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
